---
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="brand footer-brand"><span class="brand-mark mini" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span><span>Cockpit Apps</span></div>
      <p>为热爱开源与自托管的人，整理值得探索的应用。</p>
      <small>独立的应用展示目录，并非 Cockpit 官方网站或安装插件。</small>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a href={withBase('/apps/')}>应用目录</a>
      <a href={withBase('/about/')}>关于项目</a>
      <a href={withBase('/legal/')}>来源与许可</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
